#: includes/class-sva-privacy.php
msgid "Simple Visitor Analytics"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sva-privacy.php
msgid "Simple Visitor Analytics does not store personal data linked to an individual email address."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sva-privacy.php
msgid "Simple Visitor Analytics collects privacy-focused, aggregate website usage data. It does not use cookies or persistent visitor identifiers, and it does not store raw IP addresses."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sva-privacy.php
msgid "For daily uniqueness estimates, the plugin hashes an anonymized IP address (the last IPv4 octet is removed), the browser user agent, a site salt, and the current date. The daily salt means the resulting visitor hash is rotated and is not intended to identify an individual or track visitors across sites."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sva-privacy.php
msgid "When country information is available, only a country code is retained. No city-level location data is stored. Analytics data is stored in this site's own WordPress database and is subject to the site owner's configured retention period."
msgstr ""

